Spec: Follow direction

Purpose:
  Direction values and the join-zone and movement decisions. Part of the follow tracker.

Owns:
  ./follow_direction.dart
  /test/domain/follow_direction_test.dart

References:
  ./follow_tracker.sdd
  /docs/specs/history/18-follow-reverse.md

Must:
  A start or finish zone the route also passes mid-route leaves the direction undecided.
  Forward wins on a short open route whose start and finish zones overlap.
  Where the route runs both ways along one road, forward is the default.
